Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`miniapp/node/vendor/dynamic-workflows/` contains an unmodified copy of the
`mcode-dynamic-workflows` plugin runtime (version 0.8.2) by hetaoBackend,
obtained from:

    https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Code-Plugins/tree/main/plugins/hetaoBackend/mcode-dynamic-workflows

That component is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its full
license text is in `miniapp/node/vendor/dynamic-workflows/LICENSE`, and its
attribution is in `miniapp/node/vendor/dynamic-workflows/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt`.
The differences between the vendored copy and the upstream package are recorded
in `miniapp/node/vendor/dynamic-workflows/VENDOR.md`.

The vendored copy also bundles QuickJS (`dist/quickjs.wasm`); its attribution
is in the same THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt file.
